## TROUBLESHOOTING

### No input detected:
- Verify ViGEmBus is installed and running  
- Ensure the controller is connected before launching StickXSwap  
- Check HidHide configuration  

---

### Duplicate input in game:
- Verify HidHide configuration is correct  
- Ensure the physical controller is hidden from the game  
- Ensure only StickXSwap has access to the controller input  

---

### Swap not working:
- Verify HidHide configuration  
- Restart StickXSwap after changing HidHide settings  
- Run both the game and StickXSwap with the same privilege level (Admin or normal)  

---

### Hotkey not responding:
- Some games capture Alt input in exclusive fullscreen mode  
- Try alt-tabbing out of the game, then press the hotkey again  
- Use windowed or borderless fullscreen mode  
